*June 22nd - '''Team Spirit''' bench [[s1ren]] and [[w0nderful]]. Additionally, [[Patsi]] is acquired by [[Team Liquid]]. <ref name="bench trio">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1671926092792315914|title=Our sincere thanks to @PatsiCSGO, @s1ren_7 and @w0nderfulof for their time in the main roster!|date=2023-06-22|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref><ref name="-Patsi2">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamLiquidCS/status/1671958986223157248|title=Welcome Patsi!|date=2023-06-22|author=[[Team Liquid]]}}</ref>
