*July 10th - [[w0nderful]] is acquired by [[Sprout]]. <ref name="-w0nderful">{{cite web|url=https://sprout.gg/new-horizons/|title=NEW HORIZONS|date=2023-07-10|publisher=[[Sprout]]}}</ref>
*July 31st - [[s1ren]] is acquired by [[BetBoom Team]]. <ref name="-s1ren">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/BetBoomTeam/status/1685938094459998208|title=NEW ROSTER|date=2023-07-31|author=[[BetBoom Team]]}}</ref>
*December 17th - '''Team Spirit''' bench [[ArtFr0st]] and acquire [[sh1ro]] from [[Cloud9]]. <ref name="+sh1ro">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1736446744227930337|title=Introducing the newest member of our CS Roster|date=2023-12-17|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>

|content8=
* January 7th - [[ArtFr0st]] is acquired by [[PARIVISION]]. <ref name="ArtFr0st peri">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/parivisiongg/status/1744014037770232254|title=PARIVISION updated roster here!|date=2024-01-07|author=[[PARIVISION]]}}</ref>
*December 15th - '''Team Spirit''' win the [[Perfect World/Major/2024/Shanghai|Perfect World Major]] in Shanghai, defeating [[FaZe Clan]] 2-1 in the grand final.

|content9=
* July 7th - '''Team Spirit''' bench [[magixx]] and acquire [[zweih]] from [[Nemiga Gaming]]. <ref name="magixx bench">{{cite web|url=https://teamspirit.gg/article/6869433d69dddf002394f8d1|title=Team Spirit and magixx bid farewell to each other|date=2025-07-07|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref><ref name="+zweih">{{cite web|url=https://teamspirit.gg/article/686bb6c769dddf002394f8d4|title=Welcome Zweih|date=2025-07-07|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* September 8th - '''Team Spirit''' bench [[zont1x]] and acquire [[tN1R]] from [[HEROIC]]. <ref name="zont1x bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Team__Spirit/status/1965052602422587684|title=Miroslav "zont1x" Plakhotia becomes inactive|date=2025-09-08|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref><ref name="+tn1r">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/Team__Spirit/status/1965053344004919417|title=Welcome, @tN1Rcs|date=2025-09-08|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* December 18th - '''Team Spirit''' bench [[chopper]] and [[zweih]] and reinstate [[magixx]] and [[zont1x]] to the starting lineup. <ref name="chopper zweih bench, magixx zont1x back">{{cite web|url=https://teamspirit.gg/article/6943e69669dddf002394f90f|title=Changes in the Team Spirit CS2 roster|date=2025-12-18|publisher='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
* December 30th - [[zweih]] is acquired by [[PARIVISION]]. <ref name="-zweih">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Team__Spirit/status/2006002475187548366|title=Ivan "zweih" Gogin joins PARIVISION effective immediately|date=2025-12-30|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>

|content10=
*June 4th - '''Team Spirit''' promote [[S0tF1k]] from the [[Team Spirit Academy|academy team]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="s0tf1k asst. coach">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Team__Spirit/status/2062595923717353813|title=New Structure of the Team Spirit Coaching Staff|date=2026-06-05|author='''Team Spirit'''}}</ref>
}}

