|name2=2026
|This=2
|content1=
* October 19th - '''Team Voca''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' by signing [[Getting Info]] and [[nosraC]]. <ref name="voca">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/66832/breaking-getting-info-signed-by-obscure-indian-sports-and-events-agency-the-sports-front|title=Breaking: Getting Info signed by obscure Indian sports and events agency The Sports Front|date=2025-10-19|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
