* March 17th - '''Team Voca''' part ways with [[dea]] and acquire [[junior]] and [[Jeorge]] from [[SkinRave Esports]] and [[NRG]], respectively. <ref name="+junior +Jeorge">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/team_voca/status/2034076178785701929|title=We’re excited to welcome @1juniorcs and @jeorgecs to our starting roster just in time for @fragadelphia NY, followed by @pglesports Bucharest|date=2026-03-17|author='''Team Voca'''}}</ref>
* May 14th - [[Infinite]] is acquired by [[SportsBetExpert]]. <ref name="-Infinite">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SBETeam/status/2054777083553792323|title=See you in Philly… we’re coming|date=2026-05-14|author=[[SportsBetExpert]]}}</ref>
* July 9th - [[Jeorge]] is acquired by [[NRG]]. <ref name="-Jeorge">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nrgcs2/status/2075271636559740976|title=WELCOME BACK @JEORGECS|date=2026-07-09|author=[[NRG]]}}</ref>
